 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Route53 Recovery Control Config API (2020-11-02). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Clusters are global configuration metadata reported DEPLOYED with no ClusterEndpoints: no Regional data-plane cluster is provisioned, and the Route 53 ARC cluster API that reads and changes routing control states is not served. Control panels, routing controls and safety rules are not implemented because they are read and changed by their own ARN without naming their parent; CreateControlPanel, CreateRoutingControl, CreateSafetyRule, their other operations and resource policies return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. The default control panel of a cluster is therefore not created.",
  "title": "Amazon Application Recovery Controller - Recovery Control Configuration (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2020-11-02"
 },
